Subject: [PATCH] feat(#24): classify Firebase write errors -- LOG / RETRY /
 USER ERROR / FIRE-AND-FORGET
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

MASTER PLAN item #24: 'Классифицировать Firebase write errors:
gameplay/result, presence/reconnect, lifecycle/cleanup, cosmetic/
reaction. Для каждой выбрать LOG / RETRY / USER ERROR / FIRE-AND-
FORGET. committed:false не смешивать с network reject.'

=== Step A: read-only survey ===

Enumerated all 80 genuine Firebase RTDB write/transaction call sites
in script.js (filtering out DOM .remove()/array.push() noise from a
naive grep). Worker has no client-style RTDB writes in scope for this
item -- its REST-based writes have their own, separately-audited
error architecture from #23. Classified every site by category and
current behavior; found the following concrete gaps.

=== Step B: fixes ===

1. createOnlineRoom / createRoomAndShowWaiting
   - Room creation writes now have explicit USER ERROR handling.
   - Local online-room state is rolled back on room creation reject.
   - Preflight users/<uid>/activeMatch clear prevents stale values from
     hijacking a future lobby session; room creation waits for it to
     resolve, and its reject leaves pre-existing local state untouched.
   - createOnlineRoom also listens to rooms/<code>/status as a fallback
     so activeMatch is no longer a single point of failure.
   - activeMatch/status signals share an exactly-once guarded transition.
   - Only activeMatch values equal to the current room code are accepted;
     delayed stale writes are ignored.
   - Post-transition activeMatch cleanup is bounded-retry + LOG and uses
     a stable captured ref, so retries do not hit a nulled global ref.

2. loadActiveRooms + user room-index writes
   - Missing rejects are LOG'd where the write is lifecycle/index only.
   - Gameplay is not rolled back for best-effort index maintenance.

3. attemptOwnerHumanMove
   - Raw transaction reject is now caught and logged; selection/UI state
     is reset without conflating network reject with committed:false.

4. i18n
   - Added err_room_create_failed in RU/EN/IT.

=== Tests ===

- tests/room-create-error-handling.test.js
  Covers room-create reject/success, auth loss during catch, preflight
  ordering/pending/reject/resolve, stale activeMatch, status fallback,
  exactly-once races, listener cleanup, and real retry behavior.
- tests/owner-human-move-error-handling.test.js
  Covers transaction reject vs committed:false vs success for the synced
  bot human-move path.
- tests/run.js updated to include both suites.

All existing tests remain green.
